  "description": "Core abstractions and engine for DotNetBoost.Media — upload a file once and get back a row\n      that says what it is, how big it is, what it is attached to, and where its bytes live.\n      Includes IMediaManager — the one service application code injects — the metadata store\n      contract (IMediaStore) and the storage backend contract (IMediaStorageProvider), plus the\n      provider-neutral upload path: size limits, extension rules, content-type verification\n      against the file's own bytes, SHA-256 checksums and optional deduplication.",
